Creed's going to be with us for the whole episode, guys.

145
00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:08.100
Okay, Creed, you are our first in-house visitor, right?

146
00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:11.060
I mean, we've had people call in, but you're our first in-house gueSt.

147
00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:12.220
I'm the first one.

148
00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:14.640
I might have a bathroom break or something.

149
00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:16.440
It won't be for the whole thing, but I'll be in and out.

150
00:07:16.440 --> 00:07:17.720
We can provide you with a bathroom break.

151
00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:18.240
That'd be good.

152
00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:18.640
That'd be good.

153
00:07:20.380 --> 00:07:22.180
Well, I'm old, so that's part of it, you know.

154
00:07:22.780 --> 00:07:27.140
I need everybody to know that I've already teared up twice since Creed has been here.

155
00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:27.580
Oh.

156
00:07:27.720 --> 00:07:30.560
You've said two touching – well, first of all, just seeing you.

157
00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:31.020
Oh.

158
00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:35.200
Almost burst into tears, but then you've said like five amazing things that have touched

159
00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:35.840
my heart already.

160
00:07:35.840 --> 00:07:38.920
As soon as I get together with you, it's just back – we're back on the set, you know,

161
00:07:38.960 --> 00:07:41.820
and it's all like, oh, I miss you girls.

162
00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:44.780
Creed lives down the street from me.

163
00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:45.000
Yes.

164
00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:46.820
I think everybody who knows me knows this.

165
00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:47.160
The world knows that.

166
00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:48.300
Don't give him my address, please.

167
00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:48.780
I won't.

168
00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:49.020
Okay.

169
00:07:49.060 --> 00:07:55.600
Creed's address is – his hidden key is – yes, we are neighbors, and it's one of the

170
00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:56.900
joys of my life that we're neighbors.

171
00:07:57.020 --> 00:07:59.280
I love that you're right around the corner.

172
00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:00.580
I love that we have –

173
00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:01.520
We see each other walking.

174
00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:02.320
We see each other walking.

175
00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:03.180
We see each other hiking around the street.

176
00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:03.500
We do.

177
00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:04.000
Hey!

178
00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:06.660
You were walking – was it your daughter's dog?

179
00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:07.580
Your son's dog?

180
00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:08.700
My son's little Yorkie, yeah.

181
00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:11.520
You're a little Yorkie, and I hear, hey, pumpkin, and I turn around, and it's Creed.

182
00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:16.080
And we've also maybe had some adult beverage and red solo cups.

183
00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:16.620
We may have.

184
00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:17.280
We may have.

185
00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:21.560
And we like to do a little bit of what we call the sauce trail and walk around having

186
00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:22.380
a glass of wine.

187
00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:23.560
And watching documentaries.

188
00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:24.180
Oh, yeah.

189
00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:28.460
Creed loves – anything where like animals go crazy, like planet Earth.

190
00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:29.680
Yes, all that stuff.

191
00:08:29.680 --> 00:08:30.260
I just love it.

192
00:08:30.260 --> 00:08:30.620
All right.

193
00:08:30.720 --> 00:08:32.360
Well, we are really excited to have you here.

194
00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:34.580
We are discussing the Halloween episode.

195
00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:35.240
Yes.

196
00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:36.220
