197
00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:38.020
Season 2, Episode 5.

198
00:08:38.020 --> 00:08:43.700
This was written by Greg Daniels and directed by Paul Feig, and it is the first episode that

199
00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:44.820
Creed speaks.

200
00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:46.960
Well, I actually –

201
00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:47.280
Oh, remember?

202
00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:48.260
In Diversity Day.

203
00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:51.040
In Diversity Day, I had lines with Phyllis.

204
00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:52.040
Yes, I told her.

205
00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:52.740
And they paid me afterwards.

206
00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:56.280
Well, the first AD – remember that girl we had, the first AD?

207
00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:56.740
Yeah.

208
00:08:56.900 --> 00:08:57.300
The first season?

209
00:08:57.500 --> 00:09:00.040
She thought I was part of the cast at the time.

210
00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:03.360
So, Kate – she came and we had little hands and she said, now you and Phyllis just start

211
00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:03.740
talking.

212
00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:04.640
And Phyllis said, wait.

213
00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:05.420
I said, never mind.

214
00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:06.200
It's okay.

215
00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:08.280
Never mind.

216
00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:10.040
Phyllis was going to out you.

217
00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:11.320
Phyllis was going to out me.

218
00:09:11.420 --> 00:09:12.020
So, I said, never mind.

219
00:09:12.100 --> 00:09:12.460
It's fine.

220
00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:17.120
And so, we started – and I started talking about, you know, sacrificing goats or something,

221
00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:17.460
you know.

222
00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:18.020
Of course you did.

223
00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:19.840
Trying to tell her what was on her head.

224
00:09:19.980 --> 00:09:21.720
Wait, your improv was sacrificing goats.

225
00:09:21.760 --> 00:09:22.540
Yes, yes, yes.

226
00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:24.160
So, you can hear me in the background.

227
00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:26.880
And then later they said, wait a minute, Creed's talking in the background.

228
00:09:27.340 --> 00:09:29.440
And I said, oh, shoot, how did that happen?

229
00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:31.120
Yeah, how'd that happen, Creed?

230
00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:35.480
So, they paid me on the side, but they didn't say – but we can't – I said, no, it's

231
00:09:35.480 --> 00:09:35.740
fine.

232
00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:36.460
It's fine.

233
00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:40.880
And then, not off camera, then I also was the voice for the ride.

234
00:09:41.300 --> 00:09:42.560
Yes, for the mining ride.

235
00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:43.800
For the mining ride, you know.

236
00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:44.580
You were so funny.

237
00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:46.400
I think they paid attention to that one.

238
00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:49.660
Yeah, you were so funny as the voice of the mining ride.

239
00:09:49.700 --> 00:09:49.860
Yes.

240
00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:53.600
And Isabel was watching that episode with me and she said, mom, I know that voice.

241
00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:54.620
I know that voice.

242
00:09:54.980 --> 00:09:56.840
And I was like, wait, you're – oh, my gosh.

243
00:09:56.840 --> 00:09:57.840
She was like, I think it's Creed.

244
00:09:58.480 --> 00:09:58.800
She?

245
00:09:59.080 --> 00:09:59.400
Oh, yeah.

246
00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:00.360
How discerning is she?

247
00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:02.280
She is – I mean, I didn't catch it.

248
00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:04.720
