249
00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:05.240
It's Creed.

250
00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:05.720
Yeah.

251
00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:11.500
But anyway, this is the first time where I actually had some serious lines.

252
00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:13.200
It was six and a half pages.

253
00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:16.800
I remember Ken Zabornak threw the script down and said, okay, here it is.

254
00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:18.300
This is your moment.

255
00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:19.700
Wow.

