00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:33.660
I had it backwards and forwards.

261
00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:34.040
No joke.

262
00:10:34.180 --> 00:10:34.640
I had it backwards.

263
00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:34.690
Wow.

264
00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.520
I knew this was the Rubicon.

265
00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:39.960
This is the place that I was going to get – because my intuition said, this is it.

