00:11:45.020 --> 00:11:45.660
I was desperate.

301
00:11:47.740 --> 00:11:49.820
Well, you knocked it out of the park, Creed.

302
00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:50.840
Yeah, yeah.

303
00:11:50.840 --> 00:11:50.920
Yeah.

304
00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:53.540
Well, Creed, you started out as a musician.

