00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:52.340
And I was a big fan of the Ricky Gervais show.

326
00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:54.040
So I, he gave me his number.

327
00:12:54.380 --> 00:12:58.000
Now I've never, ever called anybody like that before.

328
00:12:58.100 --> 00:13:01.760
But I called him as my intuition said, this feels right.

329
00:13:01.860 --> 00:13:02.360
This feels right.

330
00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:04.200
Ken would not have given you his number.

331
00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:06.020
I feel like Ken is so discerning.

332
00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:06.340
Oh my God.

333
00:13:06.360 --> 00:13:07.280
He didn't, no.

334
00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:08.300
If he didn't mean, call me.

335
00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:08.600
Yeah.

336
00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:09.040
Yeah.

337
00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:09.800
So he did.

