00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:14.760
And so he talked to Greg and I, then I talked to Ken later and he said, well, I talked to

339
00:13:14.760 --> 00:13:15.040
Greg.

340
00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:18.840
I told him you're a very interested, interesting and funny guy.

341
00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:23.280
And he said, well, what we'll do, and this is his words, Greg's words, we'll put him

