00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:25.900
in the background and see if we can work him into the mix.

343
00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:28.360
And that first time that was working in the mix.

344
00:13:28.460 --> 00:13:29.340
That's all I need to hear.

345
00:13:29.340 --> 00:13:37.180
Or that's why I took liberties just kind of like pretending that I was part of the group

346
00:13:37.180 --> 00:13:38.880
and that paid off, you know?

347
00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:39.460
Yes.

348
00:13:39.640 --> 00:13:40.860
Oh, I love that.

349
00:13:41.060 --> 00:13:41.640
Oh, that is so cool.

350
00:13:41.640 --> 00:13:42.380
That is awesome.

351
00:13:42.900 --> 00:13:43.600
What's next?

