00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:14.920
And we went.

406
00:16:14.920 --> 00:16:15.140
Jeez.

407
00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:16.520
But we don't know yet.

408
00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:17.300
We're just going to do that.

409
00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:18.220
We're going to shoot you both.

410
00:16:18.300 --> 00:16:19.340
We're going to see how it works out.

411
00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:20.300
Oh, my God.

