00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:31.740
I said it was Creed and it's Creed.

417
00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:32.740
You can't change my mind.

418
00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:33.800
But it was going to be one of us.

419
00:16:33.920 --> 00:16:35.260
They said it was going to be one of us.

420
00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:40.780
And I remember being a little nervous.

421
00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:43.460
Yeah.

422
00:16:43.760 --> 00:16:44.000
Yeah.

423
00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:44.840
Yeah.

