00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:25.120
Everyone was too busy meeting about my hair.

497
00:19:25.300 --> 00:19:25.460
Yeah.

498
00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:26.320
Yes, yes.

499
00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:26.820
All right.

